      equipment: 'Standard 52-card deck (and three jokers for main version)\nTable space; stakes agreed in advance if playing for money',
      dealing: 'Cards per Player: Five each\nDealing Pattern: Counter-clockwise, one card at a time\nOne card turned face up after the deal (wild indicator); remainder forms stock',
